This is an unofficial project and is not affiliated with the MoonBit team.

The deployed site bundles the prebuilt cli/* executables from
moonbit-community/cmd (https://github.com/moonbit-community/cmd), published on
mooncakes.io under the Apache License, Version 2.0. They are downloaded and
verified at build time and are not part of this repository.

Module sources, skills, registry metadata, names and marks from mooncakes.io
and download.mooncakes.io are third-party content. They are fetched on demand
and remain subject to their publishers' respective licenses and rights.
Package-manifest test fixtures include snippets from cli/sh, gaato/kbbi and
Yoorkin/cowsay; see src/lib/shell/fixtures/packages/README.md. This project's
license does not grant rights to that content.

Bundled third-party software includes:
- Svelte, SvelteKit, Tailwind CSS, daisyUI, clsx, devalue, esm-env: MIT
- xterm.js (@xterm/xterm) and @xterm/addon-fit: MIT
- fflate: MIT
- moonrun-js and its MoonBit-derived components: Apache-2.0
- @noble/ciphers: MIT
- SQLite (through moonrun-js): public domain
- Rust dependencies of moonrun-js wasm components: Apache-2.0, MIT, ISC,
  BSD-3-Clause, BSL-1.0 and Unicode-DFS-2016; see the complete software notices.

Full license texts, copyright statements, moonrun-js's upstream NOTICE and the
wasm dependency inventory are in static/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt, distributed at
/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt in the built site. Build-only tools are not deployed.
